{
    "background_story": "Atharv was a brilliant and resourceful young engineer who grew up in a small village where resources were scarce. He developed a passion for fixing things, and his friends and family would often bring him broken appliances and gadgets to repair. Atharv's talent for patching together seemingly irreparable items earned him the nickname 'The Fixer.' As he honed his skills, he began to create innovative solutions using recycled materials, which helped his community conserve resources. Atharv's expertise eventually caught the attention of a prominent tech firm, which offered him a job as a lead repair engineer. He continued to patch and perfect devices, reducing electronic waste and inspiring a new generation of makers and inventors.",
